{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-cover-usage","title":"AI 利用掩体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-cover-systems/practice/ai-cover-usage","wordCount":1765,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"ai-利用掩体\">AI 利用掩体</h1><p>玩家夸一个射击游戏「敌人 AI 聪明」，八成夸的是它们会用掩体：被压制时会缩、看到你换弹会压上、发现侧翼空当会包抄。这些行为背后不是什么高深的机器学习，而是一套「对候选掩体打分、选最优、接进行为决策」的朴素逻辑。这一篇讲 AI 的掩体决策层——如何评分选点、如何接进行为树/效用系统、如何做小队协同。它复用<a href=\"../usage/exposure-lof\">暴露与视线</a>算出的暴露质量、复用行为树骨架（AI 兄弟 hub），本篇只讲「掩体相关的那几个节点和打分项」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>AI 用掩体的主循环是「感知威胁 → 收集候选掩体 → 逐个打分 → 选最优 → 移动占据 → 使用（探头/压制）→ 条件变化时重评」。核心是<strong>打分函数</strong>：把每个候选掩体映射成一个综合分，选分最高的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[感知: 威胁位置/火力] --&gt; B[收集附近候选掩体点]&#10;  B --&gt; C[对每个候选打分]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[安全: 暴露质量 q]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[进攻: 能否打到目标]&#10;  C --&gt; C3[距离: 移动代价/暴露]&#10;  C --&gt; C4[战术: 包抄/占据/间距]&#10;  C1 --&gt; D[加权综合分 S]&#10;  C2 --&gt; D&#10;  C3 --&gt; D&#10;  C4 --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E[选最高分 + 预订]&#10;  E --&gt; F[移动占据 → 探头输出]&#10;  F --&gt; G{威胁/掩体变化?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| A\">flowchart TD\n  A[感知: 威胁位置/火力] --&gt; B[收集附近候选掩体点]\n  B --&gt; C[对每个候选打分]\n  C --&gt; C1[安全: 暴露质量 q]\n  C --&gt; C2[进攻: 能否打到目标]\n  C --&gt; C3[距离: 移动代价/暴露]\n  C --&gt; C4[战术: 包抄/占据/间距]\n  C1 --&gt; D[加权综合分 S]\n  C2 --&gt; D\n  C3 --&gt; D\n  C4 --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E[选最高分 + 预订]\n  E --&gt; F[移动占据 → 探头输出]\n  F --&gt; G{威胁/掩体变化?}\n  G --&gt;|是| A</pre><p>下面这张表列出打分函数的常见评分项，是本篇的骨架：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评分项</th>\n<th>衡量</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>倾向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>安全 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>相对威胁的掩蔽度</td>\n<td>暴露评估</td>\n<td>越高越好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进攻性</td>\n<td>从此点能否打到目标</td>\n<td>反向 LOF</td>\n<td>能打到加分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>距离</td>\n<td>到该点的移动代价/暴露</td>\n<td>导航路径</td>\n<td>越近越好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>战术</td>\n<td>包抄角、与队友间距</td>\n<td>小队协调</td>\n<td>情境相关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>占据</td>\n<td>是否已被队友预订</td>\n<td>占据字段</td>\n<td>已占则排除</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"打分函数-把-聪明-写成加权和\">打分函数：把「聪明」写成加权和</h2><p>AI 选点的本质是一个多目标打分。对每个候选掩体点，综合几项评分加权求和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = w_1\\,q + w_2\\,a - w_3\\,d + w_4\\,t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 是安全度（掩蔽质量，来自<a href=\"../usage/exposure-lof\">暴露与视线</a>的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q=1-E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 是进攻性（从该点能否命中目标——反向做一次 LOF：从该点探头位到目标），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 是距离代价（到该点的路径长度或暴露积分，来自导航），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 是战术加成（包抄角、阵型间距等）。权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定这个 AI 的「性格」：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 大是怕死的躲猫猫，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 大是激进的压上型。</p>\n<p>关键设计点是<strong>安全与进攻的张力</strong>。只看安全，AI 会躲进一个完全打不到你的角落发呆；只看进攻，AI 会站在最能打你的开阔地送死。好的掩体点是「能掩护、又能探头打到你」的——所以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 通常评估的是「探头姿态下能否命中目标」，把安全的隐蔽和有效的输出统一起来。这正是<a href=\"../usage/peek-corners\">边角探头</a>里「探头暴露」概念在 AI 侧的价值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"接进决策架构-行为树与效用-ai\">接进决策架构：行为树与效用 AI</h2><p>打分函数不是孤立的，要接进 AI 的决策骨架。两种主流接法：</p>\n<p><strong>行为树（Behavior Tree）</strong>：把「找掩体」做成一个任务节点。战斗子树里，一个 <code>TakeCover</code> 节点内部跑打分选点、返回目标，再接 <code>MoveTo</code> + <code>EnterCover</code> + <code>PeekFire</code> 序列。条件装饰器控制何时进入这棵子树（如「受到火力且当前无掩体」）。行为树的结构与节点类型见 <a href=\"../../game-ai/decision-systems/behavior-tree\">03_game-ai 行为树</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>效用 AI（Utility AI）</strong>：把「躲进掩体」「压上」「换掩体」「盲射压制」都做成候选行为，各自算一个效用值，选效用最高的执行。掩体打分是「躲进掩体」这个行为的效用输入。效用 AI 天然适合表达「安全与进攻的权衡随血量/弹药/威胁数动态变化」——快死时安全权重飙升，弹满时进攻权重上升。效用 AI 的机制见 <a href=\"../../game-ai/decision-systems/utility-ai\">03_game-ai 效用 AI</a>。</p>\n<p>在 Unreal 里，候选收集与打分常落到<strong>环境查询系统（EQS）</strong>：写一个 EQS query 生成候选掩体点、用一串 test（距离、LOS、朝向）打分，行为树直接跑这个 query 拿最优点。2026 年 UE 生态的掩体插件几乎都以「生成掩体点 + 暴露给 EQS」为标准集成方式（见 Unreal 官方 EQS 文档）。EQS 的选点逻辑与本篇打分函数是同一思想的引擎化实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小队协同-包抄-压制-错位\">小队协同：包抄、压制、错位</h2><p>单个 AI 会用掩体只是及格，一队 AI <strong>配合</strong>用掩体才让玩家头皮发麻。几种经典协同：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>包抄（flanking）</strong>：一部分 AI 用高安全权重的掩体牵制正面，另一部分绕到玩家掩体的侧翼——即玩家掩体法线覆盖不到的方向。包抄点的选择就是在打分里给「玩家掩体的暴露侧」加大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>压制（suppression）</strong>：一个 AI 持续盲射/射击玩家掩体，逼玩家缩头（降低玩家探头意愿），为队友移动创造<a href=\"../usage/cover-transitions\">掩体间移动</a>的安全窗口。压制不追求命中，追求「让你不敢探头」。</li>\n<li><strong>错位占据</strong>：用<a href=\"../detection/cover-snapping\">吸附与占据</a>的预订机制，保证队友分散占据不同掩体，不扎堆。协调层给「远离已占队友」的候选点加分。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>小队协同通常由一个<strong>队协调器</strong>（squad coordinator）统一分配角色（谁牵制、谁包抄、谁压制），再把角色约束下发到每个 AI 的打分权重里。协调器的机制属于群体 AI，见 <a href=\"../../game-ai/decision-systems/goal-oriented-action\">03_game-ai GOAP/编排</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见失败模式\">常见失败模式</h2><p>AI 用掩体最容易翻车的几处，正好对应打分函数的漏洞：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>根因</th>\n<th>修法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AI 躲进打不到你的角落发呆</td>\n<td>只评安全 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>，没评进攻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>加进攻项，用探头暴露</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AI 在两个掩体间来回横跳</td>\n<td>打分震荡，最优点频繁翻转</td>\n<td>加迟滞（当前点加成/切换代价）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三个 AI 挤一个墙角</td>\n<td>没用占据锁</td>\n<td>接预订/释放 + 间距惩罚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AI 躲在已破坏的墙后</td>\n<td>用了失效的静态掩体</td>\n<td>接动态失效通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AI 冲过火线送死</td>\n<td>距离项只看长度没看暴露</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 改用暴露积分</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「来回横跳」尤其常见——两个候选点分数接近、每帧最优翻转，AI 就在中间抖。加<strong>迟滞</strong>（hysteresis）：给当前占据的点一个额外加成，或给切换掩体加一个代价，只有新点显著更优才换。这个稳定性问题和玩家侧的手感抖动同源，进一步的调校见<a href=\"cover-tuning\">调校与手感</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>AI 用掩体的核心是打分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S=w_1 q + w_2 a - w_3 d + w_4 t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，综合安全、进攻、距离、战术；权重决定 AI 性格。</li>\n<li>关键张力是安全与进攻：好掩体是「能掩护又能探头打到你」，所以进攻项评估探头姿态下的命中能力。</li>\n<li>打分接进行为树（TakeCover 节点）或效用 AI（权衡随血量弹药动态变化）；UE 里常落到 EQS 查询+test。</li>\n<li>小队协同做包抄（攻侧翼暴露方向）、压制（逼缩头造安全窗口）、错位占据（预订+间距）；由队协调器统一分配。</li>\n<li>常见失败（发呆、横跳、扎堆、躲废墙、送死）对应打分漏洞，横跳靠迟滞、扎堆靠占据锁、送死靠暴露积分距离。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>打分用的安全度来源：<a href=\"../usage/exposure-lof\">暴露与视线</a></li>\n<li>选点后的移动：<a href=\"../usage/cover-transitions\">掩体间移动</a></li>\n<li>决策骨架：<a href=\"../../game-ai/decision-systems/behavior-tree\">03_game-ai 行为树</a>、<a href=\"../../game-ai/decision-systems/utility-ai\">效用 AI</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"AI 利用掩体","id":"ai-利用掩体"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"打分函数：把「聪明」写成加权和","id":"打分函数-把-聪明-写成加权和"},{"level":2,"text":"接进决策架构：行为树与效用 AI","id":"接进决策架构-行为树与效用-ai"},{"level":2,"text":"小队协同：包抄、压制、错位","id":"小队协同-包抄-压制-错位"},{"level":2,"text":"常见失败模式","id":"常见失败模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"暴露与视线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-cover-systems/usage/exposure-lof"},"next":{"title":"调校与手感","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-cover-systems/practice/cover-tuning"}}